{
 "title": "Cotton",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Cotton",
   "card": false,
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "c179",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Here is what all that land was for.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c180",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Across the middle of the state runs a",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c181",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "strip of dark, rich soil.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c182",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "People called it the Black Belt because of",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c183",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the color of the dirt.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c184",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Cotton grew there like nowhere else.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c185",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Steamboats piled with bales floated down the rivers",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c186",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "to Mobile, which became one of the biggest",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c187",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "cotton ports in the country.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c188",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "That cotton went onto the mills of England",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c189",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and New England.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c190",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In other words, a shirt worn in England",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c191",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "might have started life in an Alabama field.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c192",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But someone had to pick it.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c193",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 1860, Alabama had about 960,000 people.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c194",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "435,000 of them were enslaved.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c195",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Almost half the state.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c196",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And remember our street in Montgomery?",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c197",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "At the bottom of those five blocks, around",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c198",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the fountain in Court Square, enslaved people were",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c199",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "sold.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c200",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Men, women, and children.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c201",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Auctioned in the open.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c202",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "A short walk from the Capitol.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c203",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "That is why the Black Belt later got",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c204",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "its second meaning.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c205",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "It became the part of Alabama where most",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c206",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Black Alabamians lived.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c207",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "By 1860, bringing people from Africa to the",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c208",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "United States had been illegal for more than",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c209",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "50 years.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c210",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "That summer, a ship called the Clotilda slipped",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c211",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "into Mobile Bay at night.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c212",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "On board were 110 people taken from West",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c213",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Africa.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c214",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The story goes, it was all because of",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c215",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "a bet.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c216",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The men behind it hid the people in the swamps.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c217",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Then they burned the ship to hide the",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c218",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "crime.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c219",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "It was the last known slave ship to",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c220",
     "shot": "todo_cotton",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "reach America.",
     "date": null
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}